OL,3,GNEWSAPupils pen special song to give
OL,4,Aclassmates a voice
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is a special song for young people
OL,7,Fwho struggle to speak.
OL,9,FMany pupils at Mitchell House Special
OL,10,FSchool in east Belfast are non-verbal
OL,11,Fbut that does not mean they cannot
OL,12,Fcommunicate.
OL,14,FAnd to get that message across they
OL,15,Fhave written and recorded a song called
OL,16,FMy Voice.
OL,18,FIt aims to educate people about
OL,19,Falternative communication like Makaton,
OL,20,Feye gaze and electronic devices and
OL,21,Fthose who use them.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
